# weather-ingest .gitignore -- written 2026-08-12 as part of IsadoraAir
# 1.2 Phase 2B (companion-project version control). Verified against the
# actual tree at git-init time, not applied blindly from the earlier
# candidate under IsadoraAir's docs/companion-projects/.

venv/
__pycache__/
lib/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Cached/polled weather + alert state -- runtime bookkeeping, not
# source. Every current file under data/ is generated (verified at
# git-init time); excluding the whole directory rather than by
# extension so a new state file of a different type doesn't slip in.
data/

# Logs, if/when any appear here (most of these run under systemd
# oneshot units whose stdout goes to the journal, not a file, but kept
# for parity with the other companion projects).
*.log

# Deliberately NOT excluded -- media/weather_beeps.flac is a small,
# fixed, intentional audio asset wx_alert_beep.py plays, not generated
# output. Keep it tracked.
